  "网络算力": "Network hashrate", "由当前难度与链上出块推导": "Derived from difficulty and observed block times", "网络难度": "Network difficulty", "区块高度": "Block height", "等待网络快照": "Awaiting network snapshot", "平均出块": "Average block time", "供应进度": "Supply progress", "M PRL 已发行": "M PRL issued", "每日排放": "Daily issuance", "当前区块补贴推导": "Derived from the current block subsidy", "全网全成本": "Network all-in cost", "模型化网络混合成本 · 每 PRL": "Modelled blended network cost · per PRL",
