  "链上交易（24h）": "On-chain transactions (24h)", "非 coinbase 交易笔数": "Non-coinbase transaction count", "链上转账额（24h）": "On-chain transfer volume (24h)", "非 coinbase 输出总额": "Total non-coinbase output value", "活跃持仓地址": "Funded addresses", "余额超过 0.01 PRL 的地址": "Addresses holding more than 0.01 PRL", "前十地址占比": "Top 10 address share", "可验证的地址层集中度": "Observable address-level concentration", "查看全部链上数据": "View all on-chain data",
  "PRL 数据": "PRL data", "让价格回到供应、网络和对照口径之中，而不是只看一个报价。": "Read price alongside supply, network conditions and consistent comparison measures.", "PRL 市场参考价": "PRL reference price", "prlstats / CoinGecko 聚合参考": "prlstats / CoinGecko aggregated reference", "参考价 × 21 亿 PRL 最大供应量": "Reference price × 2.1 billion PRL maximum supply", "Pearl 完全稀释估值占 Bitcoin 的比例": "Pearl fully diluted value relative to Bitcoin", "查看全部数据汇总": "View all PRL data",
  "AI 交叉": "AI crossover", "Pearl 的价值不只在出块，也在于计算如何与真实推理负载相遇。": "Pearl links block production to the question of how computation meets real inference workloads.", "推理并行成本": "Concurrent inference cost",
  "一张正在承载推理负载的卡并行挖矿时，按被挤占的推理收入与新增电力计入的模型成本。此项是模型估算，非市场报价。": "Modelled cost of concurrent mining on a GPU serving inference, including displaced inference revenue and additional electricity. This is an estimate, not a market quote.",
  "prlstats 模型序列": "prlstats model series", "挖矿 / 推理收入交点": "Mining / inference revenue crossover", "每 GPU 小时挖矿收入相对于 H200 按需推理租赁价格的比例；越接近 100%，纯挖矿与出租算力的收入越接近。": "Mining revenue per GPU-hour as a percentage of the H200 on-demand inference rental price. Near 100%, mining and renting out compute generate similar revenue.", "公开模型序列 · PRL/BTC": "Public model series · PRL/BTC",
  "难度": "Difficulty", "日排放": "Daily issuance", "网络概览": "Network overview", "公开链上快照": "Public on-chain snapshot", "最近可用样本": "Last available sample", "正在读取网络快照": "Loading network snapshot", "矿池 Pools": "Mining pools", "区块 coinbase 归因 · 24 小时": "Coinbase block attribution · 24 hours", "矿池": "Pool", "出块 24h": "Blocks (24h)", "份额": "Share", "费率": "Fee", "结算": "Payout", "天": "days", "可读取的历史归因序列": "Available attribution history",
  "先按 coinbase 收款地址和矿工标签归因；无法确认的区块显示为": "Attribution uses coinbase recipient addresses and miner tags. Unidentified blocks appear as ", "，不代表一定是单人挖矿。": "; this does not necessarily mean a solo miner.",
  "链上活跃度 Activity": "On-chain activity", "公开链上数据索引": "Public on-chain data index", "交易数 / 日": "Transactions / day", "链上转账额 / 日": "Transfer volume / day", "交易费 / 日": "Transaction fees / day", "新地址 / 日": "New addresses / day", "活跃持币地址": "Funded addresses", "近 14 日趋势": "14-day trend", "币龄结构": "Coin age distribution", "按输出被花费前的持有时长分层": "Grouped by holding time before an output is spent",
